where.\n- **Incident:** I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for checkout-api, which paged on-call. The first incident request timed out, so I retried with the same idempotency key. The incident was opened once.\n\nThe incident summary covers the rollback, the partial failure, and the follow-up work: investigating the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator error. v2.3.1-rc is also marked unhealthy in staging and was not touched.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_017nTFPim9oqwwzJfUzwjDzV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01D5wY9Pq5Z7VbtyguswRKuY", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0. v2.3.1 is the unhealthy one currently running in all three regions. Rolling back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01VoRXJffym4PFUJkimDws93", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback reported a partial failure. I'll check the current state before doing anything else.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_0174eiKRLZV6mTUkYVkEuxjS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollout stopped after us-east, so us